sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FE as 前端 ResourceTransfer.vue
    participant Ctrl as ResourceController
    participant STS as ShareTransferService
    participant DAO as TaskRedisDAO
    participant C115 as Cloud115Client
    participant Org as OrganizeService
    participant Scr as PostTransferScraper

    Note over FE,STS: 阶段一：提交转存（auto=false 时到此为止，行为同原版）

    FE->>Ctrl: POST /v1/resource/115-share/transfer
        {share_code, target_directory, files, auto_organize, auto_scrape, organize_source_id?}
    Ctrl->>STS: SubmitTransfer(req)
    STS->>DAO: Create(share_transfer) + 写元数据(auto_organize/auto_scrape/...)
    STS->>STS: go executeTransfer(req)

    Note over STS,C115: 阶段二：转存执行（既有逻辑，逐个 ReceiveShare）

    loop 每个文件
        STS->>C115: ReceiveShare(share_code, fid, targetDirCID, account)
        C115-->>STS: ok / err(重试1次)
    end
    STS->>DAO: UpdateStatus(终态 completed|partial_failed|failed)

    alt auto_organize == false（默认）
        Note over STS: 不触发任何后续，与原版完全一致
    else auto_organize == true 且 未取消
        STS->>STS: go runPostTransferOrganize(taskId, req, account)

        Note over STS,Org: 阶段三：自动整理

        STS->>STS: buildAdhocOrganizeSource(req, account, folder)
            Note right of STS: organize_source_id>0 则 GetByID 复用；否则构造临时 MediaSource(Path=TargetDirectory, MediaType=推断)
        STS->>DAO: Create(share_transfer_organize) + 元数据(parent_task_id, stage=organize)
        STS->>DAO: 回填转存任务 metadata.organize_task_id
        STS->>C115: GetFileList(targetDirCID) 取视频文件 pickcode
        C115-->>STS: fileIDs(仅本次落盘文件)
        STS->>Org: OrganizeDirectoryForSource(ctx, source, targetDir, targetPath, mediaType, "move", fileIDs, onProgress, shouldStop)
        Org-->>STS: []OrganizeResult
        STS->>DAO: UpdateProgress/UpdateStatus(organize 任务)
        STS->>DAO: 回填转存任务 metadata.organize_summary

        alt auto_scrape == true 且 非全失败
            STS->>STS: go runPostTransferScrape(taskId, req, source, successFiles)

            Note over STS,Scr: 阶段四：自动刮削（按源类型分流）

            STS->>DAO: Create(share_transfer_scrape) + 元数据(parent_task_id, stage=scrape)
            STS->>DAO: 回填转存任务 metadata.scrape_task_id
            STS->>STS: selectScraper(source)
            alt 本地源
                STS->>Scr: LocalScraper.Scrape(source.ID, filePaths)
                Scr-->>STS: 真实 NFO/海报 (ScrapeService)
            else 115 云盘（本期降级）
                STS->>Scr: Cloud115Scraper.Scrape(source, filePaths)
                Scr-->>STS: skipped + "115 暂不支持 NFO 写入" (nil error)
            end
            STS->>DAO: UpdateStatus(scrape 任务 completed) + 元数据(scrape_status/skipped)
        end
    end

    Note over STS,DAO: 失败/部分失败处理
    rect rgb(250,240,240)
        Note over STS: 转存 failed → 不触发整理/刮削
        Note over STS: 转存 partial_failed → 仍整理(仅落盘文件)
        Note over STS: 整理 failed → 转存维持原终态；auto_scrape 跳过
        Note over STS: 刮削 unsupported(115) → 任务 completed+skipped，不阻断
        Note over STS: 取消传播 → shouldStop 读 IsCancelled(parentTaskId)
    end
